    "created_at": "2024-11-04T15:54:52Z",
    "updated_at": "2024-11-04T15:54:52Z",
    "body": "Seems like the behavior in Firefox is quite reasonable, and implementation doesn't need to keep track whether the file changed or not. The behavior also doesn't leak any information about some file changing or not.",
